0% chance to be poisoned. It takes 25% less damage from poisoned or badly poisoned attackers."},{"id":"soul-kindling","name":"Soul Kindling","description":"Its Psychic-type moves have a 20% chance to burn. Its Psychic-type moves deal 1.3× damage to burned targets."},{"id":"neon-circuit","name":"Neon Circuit","description":"Restores 1/16 of its max HP at the end of each turn. When an attacker makes contact with it, its rings flare and lower the attacker's accuracy by 1 stage."},{"id":"gem-orbit","name":"Gem Orbit","description":"It carries four orbiting gems. When it's hit by a super-effective move, a gem shatters and halves the damage. Works up to four times per battle."},{"id":"twin-maw","name":"Twin Maw","description":"Its biting moves strike twice, once with each head. The second bite deals 25% of the first bite's damage."},{"id":"silent-cloak","name":"Silent Cloak","description":"The first move it uses after switching in gets +1 priority. If that move has a charge turn, the charge turn is skipped."},{"id":"dread-jaws","name":"Dread Jaws","description":"Its biting moves get 1.3× power and have a 30% chance to lower the target's Attack by 1 stage."},{"id":"dynamo-down","name":"Dynamo Down","description":"After it takes damage from an attack, its next Electric-type move gets 1.5× power."},{"id":"sovereign-plumage","name":"Sovereign Plumage","description":"It takes half damage from Electric-type moves, and its Flying-type moves get 1.2× power."},{"id":"storm-talons","name":"Storm Talons","description":"Its contact moves have a 30% chance to paralyze the target."},{"id":"clinging-dust","name":"Clinging Dust","description":"When it's hit by a contact move, dust clings to the attacker and lowers its Speed by 1 stage."},{"id":"tailwind-rider","name":"Tailwind Rider","description":"The first time it enters battle, it whips up a Tailwind on its side that lasts 2 turns."},{"id":"eyespot-glare","name":"Eyespot Glare","description":"When it enters battle or Mega Evolves, it 