Evolve in battle (needs the Mega Ring).","category":"transformation","rarity":"rare","effect":{"kind":"addItem","item":"alolan-flygonite","quantity":1},"stacking":"instant","scope":"run","moneyMultiplierApplies":false,"iconAssetId":"item.alolan_flygonite"}],"descriptions":{"thornstrum":"Sound-based. Hits all adjacent opponents and goes through Substitute. Power is 1.5× against a target that is poisoned or badly poisoned. Vine Riff's answer to Toxtricity's Overdrive.","feedback-shred":"Sound-based. Hits all adjacent opponents and goes through Substitute. 20% chance to paralyze each target.","cataclysm-cannon":"Fires molten iron from its back. Its power and effect depend on Cataggron's current form. Other Pokémon that learn it through Mimic or Sketch use the Standard version.","grave-rampart":"The user slams its sludge-soaked shield into the target. Damage is calculated with the user's Sp. Def instead of its Sp. Atk. 30% chance to poison the target.","mindflare":"It sets the target's mind alight. A special move that calculates damage against the target's Defense instead of its Sp. Def, like Psyshock. 10% chance to burn.","neon-eclipse":"It charges with its rings blazing, then cuts them dark at the moment of impact. The user restores HP equal to half the damage it deals.","jewel-juggle":"Hurls its gems one after another. Hits 2–5 times in a row. Each hit has a 10% chance to lower the target's Sp. Def by 1 stage.","prism-maw":"Bites with crystal-studded jaws. A biting move that makes contact. 30% chance to lower the target's Defense by 1 stage.","dusk-volley":"A two-turn move. On the first turn the user throws back its cloak and draws its bow. On the second turn it fires a volley of shadowed arrow quills. High critical-hit ratio. If it knocks out the target, the user's Speed rises by 1 stage. A Power Herb skips the charge turn.","quake-jaw":"Lunges up from the sand and clamps down. A biting move that makes contact. It can hit Flying-type Pokémon and Pokémon with Levitate; they take neutral damage from it.","spark-splash":"Splashes the target with charged water. 20% chance to paralyze the target.","riptide-arc":"Lashes the target with a current that arcs across the water. 30% chance to paralyze. Power is 1.5× in rain.","imperial-plunge":"Dives from high above with its wings folded. Makes contact. 30% chance to lower the target's Defense by 1 stage.","storm-rend":"Slashes with charged wing claws. Makes contact and has a high critical-hit ratio. 10% chance to paralyze the target.","burrow-snap":"Snaps up from beneath the sand. A biting move that makes contact and traps the target for 4–5 turns, dealing 1/8 of its max HP at the end of each turn.","wingsong":"Vibrates its wings to make a droning hum. Sound-based, so it goes through Substitute. 20% chance to confuse the target.","cyclone-wing":"Slashes the air into a spinning cyclone. Power is 1.5× while Tailwind is active on the user's side.","hypnospot":"Flashes the eye patterns on its wings. 10% chance to make the target fall asleep. When Mega Alolan Flygon uses it, the chance rises to 30%.","rune-jab":"A quick punch charged with rune light. A punching move with +1 priority.","bastion-fist":"Swings its fist like a battering ram. A punching move that makes contact. It breaks the target's Reflect, Light Screen and Aurora Veil before dealing damage.","coral-splash":"Sprays water full of sharp coral grit. 30% chance to lower the target's Speed by 1 stage.","pearl-pulse":"Fires a beam of light from its pearls. A pulse move. 20% chance to raise the user's Sp. Def by 1 stage.","reef-tempest":"Calls up a storm from the reef. After it hits, rain starts and lasts 3 turns, or 5 turns if the user holds a Damp Rock.","cataclysm-cannon-defence":"Fires molten iron from its back. Its power and effect depend on Cataggron's current form. Other Pokémon that learn it through Mimic or Sketch use the Standard version.","cataclysm-cannon-attack":"Fires molten iron from its back. Its power and effect depend on Cataggron's current form. Other Pokémon that learn it through Mimic or Sketch use the Standard version.","hypnospot-mega":"Flashes the eye patterns on its wings. 10% chance to make the target fall asleep. When Mega Alolan Flygon uses it, the chance rises to 30%."}}
